OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to arson after
OL,4,Apark fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to arson after
OL,7,Fsetting several fires in east London
OL,8,Fthe day after the government sent out
OL,9,Fan emergency alert warning of the
OL,10,Fheightened risk of wildfires.
OL,12,FIsaac Shozi, 50, of Bodney Road,
OL,13,FHackney, admitted starting the fires
OL,14,Fbut denied a more serious charge of
OL,15,Farson with recklessness as to whether
OL,16,Flife was endangered.
OL,18,FHe is accused of starting "a number of
OL,19,Ffires" in London Fields, an area of
OL,20,Fparkland owned by Hackney Council, on
OL,21,F15 August.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
